<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Generador de App Android (TWA/PWA)</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0e1117;
            --card-bg: #161b22;
            --accent-color: #00d2ff;
            --text-color: #e6edf3;
            --subtext-color: #8b949e;
            --border-color: #30363d;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 90vh;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--subtext-color);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .step {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #21262d;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .step-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .code-box {
            background: #0d1117;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #7ee787;
            overflow-x: auto;
            position: relative;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: #30363d;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .preview-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            object-fit: cover;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .flex-center {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="flex-center">
        <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/columbus1100/app-calorias/main/icon.png" alt="Icono Neón" class="preview-icon" id="iconImg" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/80/00d2ff/000000?text=App'">
        <h1>Calorías AI Pro - APK Creator</h1>
        <p>Genera la aplicación Android omitiendo las restricciones de Streamlit Cloud.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <div class="step-title">Paso 1: Copia tu Manifest Completo</div>
        <p>Este código incluye la URL directa de tu icono de neón subido a tu GitHub:</p>
        <div class="code-box" id="manifestCode">{
  "name": "Calorías AI Pro",
  "short_name": "Calorías AI",
  "start_url": "https://app-calorias-ycreehfhciajrwt3pdgknf.streamlit.app/",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#0E1117",
  "theme_color": "#0083B8",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/columbus1100/app-calorias/main/icon.png",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    }
  ]
}</div>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="copyCode()">📋 Copiar Manifest</button>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <div class="step-title">Paso 2: Generar APK mediante PWABuilder Studio</div>
        <p>Abre el empaquetador directo (sin análisis de URL):</p>
        <a href="https://www.pwabuilder.com/publish" target="_blank" class="btn">🚀 Abrir PWABuilder Studio</a>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <div class="step-title">Paso 3: Instrucciones en PWABuilder Studio</div>
        <ol style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--subtext-color); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <li>Pega el código JSON que has copiado arriba.</li>
            <li>En la sección de icono, verifica que carga la imagen del plato de neón.</li>
            <li>Haz clic directamente en <b>Generate Android Package</b> para descargar tu paquete `.apk` / `.aab`.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    function copyCode() {
        const text = document.getElementById('manifestCode').innerText;
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
            alert('¡Código manifest copiado al portapapeles!');
        });
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
